### Environment / secrets ###
# Real secrets live only in the untracked per-environment files (.env.do on the
# Droplet, .env.aws on the AWS host) and must never be committed. The committed
# .env.*.example files are placeholders-only templates.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

